title: Junior PR Account Executive
description: &nbsp;Communication EFFECT is an integrated communication services agency based in Athens, Greece and an Edelman affiliate since 2000 for both Greece &amp; Cyprus. Edelman is the biggest independent PR network globally. We are currently looking to add a Junior PR account executive to our team who will be in charge of managing various accounts for both greek &amp; international clients. Please see below the required skills &amp; if you think you fit please drop us a line. All applications will be treated in strict confidentiality.&nbsp;
requirements: Post graduate Degree (ex. MA) in PR, Communication or related field &nbsp;Copy-writing skills &nbsp;Presentation skills &nbsp;Project management skills &nbsp;Microsoft Office package knowledge &nbsp;Excellence in online marketing &amp; social media accounts management (ex. Facebook, Twitter) &nbsp;Basic online publishing tools knowledge (ex. Wordpress) &nbsp;Basic image editing tools knowledge &nbsp;Ability to work under pressure and strict deadlines &nbsp;Fluency &nbsp;in both Greek and EnglishAn extra language will be an asset&nbsp;Self motivated, goal oriented &amp; team player &nbsp;1-2 years of professional experience (preferably in International Market) &nbsp;Age from 26 &ndash; 30 (preferably)&nbsp;
benefits: Challenging accounts &amp; projectsOngoing professional trainingAccess to Edelman's expertise/networkFriendly work environment

