title: Project Manager
description: We are currently recruiting for IT Project Managers to lead our web development and data migration projects. Responsibilities include:— project management, time management— phone calls, work on project scopes and requirements;
requirements: — very good English (phone calls and emails)— 5+ years of IT project management experience with a minimum of 2 years of supervisory experience.— Understanding of hosting industry and working experience in the area (servers: configuration, installation, data migration, LAMP, Windows server, Cloud, DNS, web services, web hosting). Working with Rackspace,Peer1, Softlayer, Amazon.— Understanding of web development industry and experience here (PHP, mySQL, MS SQL,.NET, CMS)will be a plus:Understanding and experience in the following areas:— LAMP (configuration, debugging)— PHP (development)— hosting (servers: configuration, installation, data migration)
benefits: — good salary — bonuses, sick days and vacations;— lunch and taxi;— smart team and friendly atmosphere;

