title: Marketing Consultant
company_profile: At Total Eclipse we create fun, original, and addictive games that are easy to learn yet hard to master. We have a strong history of game releases, with 9 shipped games in 10 years, across different genres and #URL_d09fcd5154ef7c470dcdf6a9151af4f73dbcc5bda134912e2dedf1da67449c12# purpose is to ‘Popularise Play’; we want to get more people to enjoy games as we believe that there is a potential gamer in each one of us.This is a truly exciting time for Total Eclipse! We are growing, and we intend to become one of the top brands in multiplatform casual gaming. Are you ready to be part of a small and agile team with a great vision? Then keep reading!Are we a good match?Every new addition to the team helps define Total Eclipse’s future, so we want to make sure we would be a good match for each other.  We have many of the good qualities of a sta
description: Total Eclipse is looking for a Marketing Consultant (contractor or company) who will define the marketing strategy for future titles but also work with us in strengthening the Total Eclipse brand. We want that 'someone' to love working with indies.Help us elevate the Total Eclipse brand and reach millions of peopleDefine the overall marketing strategy for our mobile and desktop productsKeep the press excited about our current and future gamesDefine communication strategy (social media, newsletters, etc.)Write and distribute press releases&nbsp;
requirements: Has successfully promoted games that became hitsHas strong connections with the global industry&rsquo;s press and review sitesHas good knowledge of the desktop and mobile games market&nbsp;&nbsp;
benefits: The ability to be part of a fun, dynamic and agile team with a solid history of game creation.The chance to contribute in exciting new projects reaching a global audience.A competitive salary.A great location in Greece's second largest city.Opportunities for advancement and learning.
